# Pump caps stop at catch tests, immediately before choice, and just after choice.
# Transfer is stopped at entry to the policy cleanup copy: ordinary cancellation abandons
# the current cleanup rather than restarting it, so its 5 is absent in transfer cleanup.
# Cancellation rolls back policy writes, then runs retained and active policy finally scopes once.
