> deliver d1 to=tests message=go
> pump clock=2026-10-06T09:00:00Z fuel-cap=39
raise tests/r1 code="bad" at=tests:7 pos=5:3
preempt tests/r1 start delivery=d1 handler=go clause=1 by=cap fuel=39 alloc=48
pumped state=sliced fuel=39
> counters tests
counters tests fuel=39 alloc=48 runs=1 faults=0 state=1230 mailbox=0
